cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "UnDetect demo: a reproducible pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that trains and tests UnDetect, a model of transcriptional responses to compounds it has
  never seen, on simulated data: a locked Pixi environment, a Snakemake workflow, a Quarto report and a GitHub
  Action that reruns everything from a clean clone.
